WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.270
Hi everyone, my name is Braydon.

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:06.470
This is my new tool, Sales Call Cheat Code.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:11.780
I just download my calls and drag them right in here.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:20.380
The AI can actually tell who on the call is who, based on their pitch.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.520
I click Jordan. That's the loan officer.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.700
The AI shows a recap of the whole call.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.000
It takes the notes for you,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.080
which probably saves you

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.640
one, two, three minutes easily, each call.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.290
What to do better is a section I love,

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.850
and what you did well.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:46.390
A lot of my reps have been using it to listen to their own calls and get better.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.280
On a live call, it reads the transcription,

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.980
tells you good lines to say and things to ask,

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.160
while you're on the live call.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.700
Thank you for your time.
